{% comment %}
  Fonts: Lora (headings) and Roboto (text) only, both from Shopify's font library (the theme's font settings).

  2 Nov 2026 (Anu: "let's stick to two fonts and make the page faster"): the self-hosted copies of Lora 400/500/600/700,
  Roboto 200/300 and Assistant 400 were removed. Lora 500 and 700 existed twice (library + own file, both downloaded:
  the preloaded Lora-Medium was never used, the library's face came later and won), Roboto 200/300 were not used, and
  Assistant was a third family (menu, phone menu, policy pages; these now use the body font, Roboto).

  The first-screen fonts (Roboto 400, Lora 500) are preloaded by snippets/fonts.liquid; bold and italic come from
  snippets/theme-styles-variables. Here only the two other Lora weights our sections use (400: links, quotes, About text;
  600: About process steps), also from the library. A browser downloads a weight only on a page that uses it.
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign ea_lora_400 = settings.type_heading_font | font_modify: 'weight', '400'
  assign ea_lora_600 = settings.type_heading_font | font_modify: 'weight', '600'
-%}
{% style %}
  {%- if ea_lora_400 -%}{{ ea_lora_400 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{%- endif -%}
  {%- if ea_lora_600 -%}{{ ea_lora_600 | font_face: font_display: 'swap' }}{%- endif -%}
{% endstyle %}
